{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":11,"count":37,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-12\",\"张\",\"張\",\"张\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要買一張桌子跟四張椅子。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào mǎi yì zhāng zhuōzi gēn sì zhāng yǐzi.","english":"I want to buy one table and four chairs.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-12","sourceFront":"張","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"客廳裡面有兩張沙發。","pinyin":"Kètīng lǐmiàn yǒu liǎng zhāng shāfā.","english":"There are two sofas in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-19","sourceFront":"沙發","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你的房間裡有幾張椅子？","pinyin":"Nǐ de fángjiān lǐ yǒu jǐ zhāng yǐzi?","english":"How many chairs are there in your room?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-14","sourceFront":"有","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這張畫很好看，我很喜歡。","pinyin":"Zhè zhāng huà hěn hǎokàn, wǒ hěn xǐhuān.","english":"This painting is brilliant. I like it very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-10","sourceFront":"畫","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L08-2-08\",\"襪子\",\"襪子\",\"袜子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想買一雙黑色的鞋子和一雙白色的襪子。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng mǎi yī shuāng hēisè de xiézi hé yī shuāng báisè de wàzi.","english":"I want to buy a pair of black shoes and a pair of white socks.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-11","sourceFront":"黑","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"室友老是把髒襪子扔在地上，希望他能把這個壞習慣改掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-25","sourceFront":"扔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我買了一雙除臭的襪子送給他。 (V)","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-22","sourceFront":"除","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"襪(sock) + 子(noun suffix): a sock → 子 just makes it a noun."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-13\",\"左邊\",\"左（邊）\",\"左（边）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你先往左轉，再往右轉，就到那家餐廳了。","pinyin":"Nǐ xiān wǎng zuǒ zhuǎn, zài wǎng yòu zhuǎn, jiù dào nà jiā cāntīng le.","english":"First turn left, then turn right, and you'll arrive at that restaurant.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-14","sourceFront":"轉","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"左邊的照片比右邊的好看。","pinyin":"Zuǒbiān de zhàopiàn bǐ yòubiān de hǎokàn.","english":"The photo on the left side is better looking than the one on the right side.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-01","sourceFront":"邊","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華語書籍陳列在書架的左邊，如有興趣可隨意翻翻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-30","sourceFront":"陳列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"感冒要是一個星期左右還沒好，就應該去看醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-07","sourceFront":"左右","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們應該培養獨立思考的能力，別被身邊各種訊息左右。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-23","sourceFront":"左右","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國立博物館正在展覽公元三百年左右的古文物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-01","sourceFront":"公元","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"左(left) + 邊(side) → the left side: 左邊."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-08\",\"元宵節\",\"元宵節\",\"元宵节\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個星期六是元宵節，妳跟友美會去看燈會嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè ge xīngqī liù shì Yuánxiāojié, nǐ gēn Yǒuměi huì qù kàn dēnghuì ma?","english":"This Saturday is the Lantern Festival. Will you and Youmei go to see the Lantern Carnival?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"元(first) + 宵(night) + 節(festival) → the festival of the first full-moon night: the Lantern Festival."},{"key":"[\"B2L02-2-22\",\"垃圾桶\",\"垃圾桶\",\"垃圾桶\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-35\",\"獎學金\",\"獎學金\",\"奖学金\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"付了房租以後，你這個月的獎學金還剩多少？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他的成績很好，有機會得到出國留學的獎學金。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-13","sourceFront":"得到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大學給我一封正式的信，通知我得到獎學金了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-21","sourceFront":"通知","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想得到獎學金，必須達成每科成績八十五分以上的要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-05","sourceFront":"達成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的法國朋友最初只計畫來臺灣學中文，沒想到後來拿到了獎學金，還念了博士班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-24","sourceFront":"最初","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付完學費，我的獎學金只剩下三千塊，這個月只有吃饅頭過日子了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-07","sourceFront":"只有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想申請獎學金的話，得先影印你的證件，再把影本寄給學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-25","sourceFront":"影印","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的獎學金申請書因少了一份資料，已被學校退回。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-52","sourceFront":"退回","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次申請獎學金，達到標準的學生總共不超過十人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-07","sourceFront":"總共","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-2-13\",\"化妝\",\"化妝\",\"化妆\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"隔壁的王媽媽化妝以後，變年輕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-22","sourceFront":"變","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雲小姐最近突然開始化妝了，人也變美了。大家都猜她戀愛了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-14","sourceFront":"猜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說，男人的話題常跟政治有關，女人的話題不是名牌包、就是化妝品。你同意嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-14","sourceFront":"話題","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妳去面試時稍微化妝一下，是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-40","sourceFront":"稍微","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她愛好化妝、穿名牌服裝，目的是希望別人讚美她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-12","sourceFront":"讚美","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對夏天一活動汗就流個不停的女性來說，化妝實在是件麻煩事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-29","sourceFront":"汗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"客人都抵達婚禮現場了，新娘卻還沒開始化妝，太誇張了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-04","sourceFront":"新娘","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種化妝品是針對東方人的皮膚設計的，在臺灣賣得很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-12","sourceFront":"針對","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-2-11\",\"存\",\"存\",\"存\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我覺得把錢存在銀行比放在家裡安全多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-11","sourceFront":"存","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小韓早晚都打工，是因為想多存一些錢，早一點完成出國念書的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-09","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽對哥哥說，以他現在剛上班的情況，不能急著買房子，得等錢存夠了再買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-31","sourceFront":"以","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的會議資料都存在雲端，這樣又安全又方便，各部門也能隨時參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-01","sourceFront":"雲端","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他把存了半輩子的錢都拿去做生意，結果生意不成功，錢都沒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-22","sourceFront":"沒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸虧我把資料都存在雲端，要不然找不到隨身碟，怎麼開會呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在華人社會中，「龍」具有重要的文化意義，但「龍」其實是不存在的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-25","sourceFront":"存在","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上帝是不是存在，這是屬於宗教領域的問題，科學家的解釋不一定是正確的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-15","sourceFront":"領域","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛來臺灣，不知道怎麼在銀行開戶存錢，請教我怎麼申請。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-48","sourceFront":"申請","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前人們常用磁帶來存電腦的重要資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-14","sourceFront":"磁帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你在銀行存的錢越多，得到的利息也越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-21","sourceFront":"利息","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我習慣來這家銀行存款，因為這裡的員工都十分親切。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-26","sourceFront":"存款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你在辦一些國家的簽證時，他們得看你的銀行存款。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-26","sourceFront":"存款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"會賺錢雖然重要，可是有的人認為會存錢、不亂花錢更重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-26","sourceFront":"賺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這些帶子是我小學的記錄，我請朋友把它存進電腦裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-19","sourceFront":"帶子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"假如擔心弄丟重要的資料，可複製一份存在電腦裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-17","sourceFront":"複製","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"保存食物的方式會影響食物的新鮮程度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-22","sourceFront":"保存","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 子(child) is present; as long as the 子(child) remains, it exists → 存(exist)."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-34\",\"从不\",\"從不\",\"从不\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"李先生從不吃泡麵、薯條、熱狗那樣的食物，因為他覺得不健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-34","sourceFront":"從不","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我家的狗很乖，從不破壞家裡的東西","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-20","sourceFront":"破壞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"石先生對自己的想法很堅持，從不接受別人的意見，所以很難相處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-07","sourceFront":"堅持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"商先生從不發脾氣，人也很謙虛，不論別人怎麼批評他，他還是很客氣地說謝謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-26","sourceFront":"不論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要維持社區良好的生活品質，就要從不亂丟垃圾、減少家庭噪音做起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-13","sourceFront":"維持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我旅行的方式很隨意，出發前從不先規劃行程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-34","sourceFront":"隨意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-1-42\",\"風雨聲\",\"風雨聲\",\"风雨声\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"昨天晚上的風雨聲好可怕，讓我整個晚上都沒睡好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-42","sourceFront":"風雨聲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Hearing the blowing 風(wind) and falling 雨(rain) echo as natural 聲(sound once): 風雨聲 means sound of wind and rain."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-2-15\",\"公共\",\"公共\",\"公共\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"國家圖書館和博物館都是公共資源，任何人都可以使用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-15","sourceFront":"公共","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這座古老的城市因為公共設備太舊，購物也不方便，不少人都搬走了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-05","sourceFront":"古老","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了提高這座城市的文化水準，市長積極建設藝術表演中心、圖書館等公共空間","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像機場、高鐵、捷運這類公共交通建設，都需要很多經費才能完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據本大樓的管理規定，私人物品不可堆在公共區域。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-25","sourceFront":"私人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 公(public) and 共(all): 公共 means public."},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-16\",\"閒\",\"閒\",\"闲\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"太太：要是你閒著沒事，就幫我泡一壺熱茶吧。先生：我哪裡閒？我馬上要開雲端會議了，可是忙得很呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-16","sourceFront":"閒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校蓋了一棟活動中心，學生又多了一個交流、休閒的好場所了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-06","sourceFront":"蓋","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我覺得減少工作，增加有意義的休閒活動，這樣的生活比較充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-21","sourceFront":"減少","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"當人們生活水準提高，開始重視生活品質時，休閒活動也就跟著多了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-31","sourceFront":"水準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"市場為了改善兒童和青少年的生活品質，而增加了球場、游泳池等休閒場所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-14","sourceFront":"場所","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我最喜歡的休閒活動是爬山和露營","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-01","sourceFront":"休閒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了身體和心理的健康，就算再忙，假日也應該休閒一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-01","sourceFront":"休閒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"對我來說，閱讀醫學系列的小說是一個很好的休閒活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-04","sourceFront":"系列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我小時候最棒的休閒活動是到爺爺的菜園挖地種菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-13","sourceFront":"挖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Opening the heavy courtyard 門(door), the gentle 月(moon) shines down during hours of peaceful 閒(leisure)."},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-01\",\"茶饮\",\"茶飲\",\"茶饮\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家便利商店現在有「咖啡、茶飲買一送一」的優惠活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-01","sourceFront":"茶飲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-06\",\"揀\",\"揀\",\"拣\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那位客人在地攤買東西揀來揀去，最後又不買，難怪老闆滿臉不高興的樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-06","sourceFront":"揀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-08\",\"刚好\",\"剛好\",\"刚好\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"冷氣的溫度要是控制得剛好，不但對健康好，也能省點兒電費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-08","sourceFront":"剛好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我往東走，你往西走，我們兩個的方向剛好相反。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-19","sourceFront":"相反","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我到公車站的時候，剛好有一班公車來了，要不然上班就遲到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-08","sourceFront":"要不然","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我要打電話給他的時候，他剛好打來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-20","sourceFront":"剛好","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-06\",\"煩惱\",\"煩惱\",\"烦恼\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個人都有煩惱，如果能好好處理，就能從過程中得到經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-06","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"時間有時能消除煩惱，不能解決的事就暫時放在一邊吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-47","sourceFront":"消除","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"購物是一種享受，超過個人需求的消費，卻只會帶來煩惱。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-43","sourceFront":"享受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在學習新知識的過程中，總是會有開心與煩惱的時候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-08","sourceFront":"過程","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他很煩惱，不知道畢業以後要找什麼工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-20","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-02\",\"報\",\"報\",\"报\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這位記者專門報導社會新聞，他報新聞的方式相當專業。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-02","sourceFront":"報","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家報社非常細心，他們的文章從沒出現過一個錯字。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-12","sourceFront":"報社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你想參加這項長跑比賽的話，可以到網站報名，登記之後會有人跟你聯絡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-02","sourceFront":"登記","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小王的閱讀報告寫得很精彩，連教授都在課堂上當面誇獎他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-44","sourceFront":"誇獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"昨天電視臺的氣象報告說今天會下雨，果然一大早就下起雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-52","sourceFront":"果然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師不滿意我們這一組的報告，要我們重做一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-55","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"上臺報告以前要把資料準備好，以免到時候手忙腳亂的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-37","sourceFront":"上臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"學校的游泳比賽報名時間到今天截止，有興趣的同學別錯過了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-20","sourceFront":"截止","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現代社會資訊很發達，一發生重要事情，立刻就上電視、上報了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-01","sourceFront":"資訊","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你寄報告給老師前最好確認一下地址，萬一老師沒收到，到時你就麻煩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-19","sourceFront":"到時","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"到新公司報到以前，應先把個人的態度及觀念調整好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-04","sourceFront":"報到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這條路不平，有民眾貼了海報，請大家走路時要小心，以免受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-26","sourceFront":"以免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"林伯伯透過網路、報紙，尋找三十年前因為戰爭而分開的家人，最後終於找到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-31","sourceFront":"尋找","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我的歷史作業寫完了，同時也把明天要報告的古蹟資料準備好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-03","sourceFront":"同時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有一份研究報告表示，對陌生環境適應能力越強的人，未來成功的機會也越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-18","sourceFront":"陌生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"報名衝浪課的手續很簡單，只要到辦公室填一張基本資料表就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-28","sourceFront":"表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"氣象預報說，從明天起一連三天，中部以北地氣溫只有十五度，出門時最好加件外套。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-34","sourceFront":"氣溫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"氣象預報人員確定明天颱風會來，我們最好去吃超市買一些泡麵、雞蛋","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-29","sourceFront":"確定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"要是你想知道山區天氣的情況，上網看看氣象預報就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-17","sourceFront":"預報","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個週末我過得很充實，不但完成了期末報告，還跟同學去游泳、衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-07","sourceFront":"充實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"新聞報告說颱風快來了，出門時得注意安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-02","sourceFront":"颱風","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"多閱讀書報、雜誌，能讓我們的知識更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-08","sourceFront":"閱讀","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"媽媽替我報名了亞洲鋼琴比賽，她說只要我肯努力，一定會有好成績的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-21","sourceFront":"肯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？昨天晚上沒睡好嗎？ B:嗯。要不是開夜車趕報告， 現在也不會這麼沒精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-36","sourceFront":"嗯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在德國舉辦的歐洲足球比賽，一共有十二個國家報名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-30","sourceFront":"報名","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那位教授看報告看得很仔細，你可不能亂寫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-09","sourceFront":"仔細","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"等我完成期末報告，就要跟同學去韓國旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-04","sourceFront":"完成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師的要求很多，要寫五篇報告、三篇作文，怎麼寫得完？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-02","sourceFront":"要求","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了做這個報告，經理已經跟我們開過三次會了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-26","sourceFront":"開會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我是陳老闆的助理，每天得向他報告公司的情況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-20","sourceFront":"向","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"上中文課時，老師要我們用中文報告在台灣的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-10","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個週末我得在家做一份報告，不能出去玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-23","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"爸爸每天早上一起床就看報紙。","pinyin":"Bàba měitiān zǎoshang yì qǐchuáng jiù kàn bàozhǐ.","english":"Every morning as soon as Dad gets out of bed, he reads the newspaper.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-18","sourceFront":"報紙","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"A grant of royal 幸(favor) stamped with a 卩(seal) is carried out 又(again) to proudly 報(announce) good news."},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-49\",\"支\",\"支\",\"支\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那支軍隊受的是特殊訓練，只在發生重大戰爭時才派出。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-49","sourceFront":"支","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"公司全體都支持昨天公告的那條規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-18","sourceFront":"全體","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"他失業了，但妻子三人卻仍在一旁支持著他，讓他安心了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-22","sourceFront":"妻子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有些學校將教育當成商品來買賣，但也有人不支持。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-30","sourceFront":"買賣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我習慣把每一筆支出都記錄起來，提醒自己少花點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-17","sourceFront":"支出","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我想了許多辦法去達成公司的目標，卻還是得不到主管的支持。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-32","sourceFront":"目標","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"假如失去了人民的信心與支持，國家也會變得不安定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-22","sourceFront":"支持","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:哎呀！我的手機掉到河裡了。 （shock or annoyance）B:那真是傷腦筋，看來你只好再買一支了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-41","sourceFront":"哎呀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"停電(power failure)的時候有支手電筒，做起事來比較方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-06","sourceFront":"手電筒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他把我的手機壓壞了，我要他買一支賠我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-16","sourceFront":"壓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公司交給你的支票記得要收好，別弄丟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-46","sourceFront":"支票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這支手錶是我過世的爺爺留給我的，對我來說具有特別的意義","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-07","sourceFront":"具有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這支手機的照相功能很強，拍出來的效果比照相機還要好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-28","sourceFront":"效果","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"臺灣人在國外碰到問題時，可以立刻打0800-085-095「你幫我，你救我」這支電話求救。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-20","sourceFront":"求救","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那支新手機的廣告做得很好，很多人都被吸引了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-07","sourceFront":"廣告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我對這支新手機很感興趣，你能給我介紹介紹嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-11","sourceFront":"感興趣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這支筆太貴了，你買便宜的吧。","pinyin":"Zhè zhī bǐ tài guì le, nǐ mǎi piányi de ba.","english":"This pen is too expensive; buy a cheap one (suggestion).","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-14","sourceFront":"吧","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"十(ten) fingers grip, and 又(again) a hand lifts the heavy 支(support) beam."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"使用\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 使(cause) and 用(use): 使用 means make use of, to employ."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"儘管\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 儘(exhaust) and 管(manage): 儘管 means even though, in spite of."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"具\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"且(yet) 一(one) 八(eight) wrenches lie on a bench → 具(tool)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"卡車\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A vehicle equipped to handle heavy 卡(card) cargo loads like an industrial 車(cart): 卡車 means truck."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"卷\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Tied grain stalks 龹(grain sheaf) beside a kneeling 卩(seal) scribe are rolled into a parchment 卷(book)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"地方\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"地(earth) + 方(direction) → a place is a direction on earth."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"捷\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 扌(hand) holds a 疌(nimble) grip → that speed is 捷(nimble)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"有意思\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"有(have) + 意(meaning) + 思(think) → if it has meaning and thought, it's interesting."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"歷\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 厤(calculate) scroll rests where the 止(stop) marks → page after page of 歷(history)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"海\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 氵(water) washes over 每(each) shell on the beach → 海(sea)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"職\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Listening with a trained 耳(ear) while reading marked 戠(sign) instructions fulfills an official 職(duty)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"荷\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) pond asks 何(what) floats so still → one pink 荷(lotus)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"護\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 言(speech) takes 蒦(measure) to guard the gate → 護(protect)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"起\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 走(walk) takes the 己(self) up and out → ready to 起(rise)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"身體\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"身(body) + 體(physique) → your body: 身體."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"酷\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The 酉(wine) 告(tells) you it is stylish and trendy, so it is 酷(cool)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"長\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Braided hair tied past 一(one) band sweeps down round a 𠄌(hooked corner) to form an elegant, 長(long) strand."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"阿姨\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 阿(an initial particle) and 姨(aunt): 阿姨 means aunt."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"預備\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 預(prepare) and 備(prepare): 預備 means prepare."}]}
